01. Three CSRs: Madrid (in Iberia), Sydney (far), NoGeo (no location)
=====================================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/csourceRegistrations/urn:ngsi-ld:R:Madrid
Content-Length: 0



HTTP/1.1 201 Created
